Third-party components and data:
- three.js r147 (app/vendor/three.min.js, app/vendor/GLTFLoader.js) — MIT License, Copyright 2010-2022 three.js authors.
- 3D models and textures in app/data/assets_data.js — Poly Haven (polyhaven.com), CC0 1.0 public domain;
  list in app/data/ASSETS_CREDITS.md.
- Datasets (not redistributed, downloaded by scripts/download_data.py) — CC BY 4.0:
  "Indoor Fire Dataset with Distributed Multi-Sensor Nodes" (Industrial Hall), Mendeley Data,
  DOI 10.17632/yghykzm4km.1, and its EN54 test-room counterpart, DOI 10.17632/npk2zcm85h.
  Attribution to the dataset authors is required when reusing the data or derived results.
- This prototype is NOT a certified fire detection system. It is an advisory, read-only layer
  for demonstration; the certified fire alarm system (EN 54 / NFPA 72) remains the safety barrier.
